\fs36 Steps\
1- import the data from csv\
2- clean the data as duplication- correction-incomplete -needs to convert the text data to numerical values(name\'97>1\'97\
3-Split the data into two segments Training set/Test Set\
4- create a model(select  algothims as neural networks depends on the problem u trued to solve- many libraries has algothim as sketlearn)\
5- Train model ( asks about data - patterns)\
6- makes predications \'97> in the first predication not always accurate \
7-evaluate and improve \
\
