Persisting model \
If u have big data set and u need to train a model it will take time so we need to save the trained model and reuse it \
\
 import job lib\
\
After training model fit (x,y)\
Add \
joblib.dump(model,\'92muisc_recommned_model\'92) \'97>return array contains name of model file\
\
If we want to load the model\
Joblib.load(\'91muisc_recommend_model\'92)\'97> will load saved model \
